::narrative: prologue_currents
@title: Prologue - Whispering Currents
::scene: drift
a faint haze of salt and brass lingers
!sfx: gulls, soft_surge
!music: overture
 !action: Sunshafts pattern across oxidized hull plates.
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Bring engines to listening idle—feel the undertow's intent."
::end: {{ drift }}
::scene: signal
@title: A Signal Beneath
!sfx: sonar_ping, valve_hiss
!vfx: pulse_glow
 !action: Resonant rings pulse through layered fog.
 [[ TINKER JAS ]]
 "It's a coded harmonic—someone's awake down there."
 [[ CAPTAIN ORLA ]]
 "Or something. Log and descend two degrees." 
::end: {{ signal }}
::end: {{ prologue_currents }}
